column9:
(1) what were the sources of syringes used by a sample of active IDUs during a 30 day period pre-ESAP; 
(2) prior to ESAP, were syringe sources for IDUs stable over time (i.e., 6 months later); 
(3) after the institution of ESAP—did the mix of sources change and
(4) what were the predictors (in terms of previous sources used and demographics) of changes insyringe sources?
